[en.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_CONSTRUCTION]
Stallioncon Valley

[en.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_CONSTRUCTION_desc]
“Move fast and break things!”\nStallioncon Valley, the ambitious plan to transform Northern Ponyville into a vibrant hub of technological innovation, and further drive the development of industrial parks across the greater Ponyville area.

[zh.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_CONSTRUCTION]
骏马谷

[zh.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_CONSTRUCTION_desc]
“快速行动，打破陈规！”\n骏马谷，这个雄心勃勃的计划旨在将北小马谷打造成一个充满活力的技术创新中心，并进一步带动整个小马谷周边地区的工业园区建设。

